Ambient","n":5},{"id":274994627985231,"type":"genre","name":"Industrial","n":4},{"id":15318882910861,"type":"genre","name":"Post-Industrial","n":2},{"id":170537203516999,"type":"genre","name":"Drone","n":1}],"labels":[],"album_labels":[],"own_scenes":[],"scenes":[{"id":145647343892302,"name":"Música industrial","book":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","start":1977,"end":1992,"desc":"El término lo usa por primera vez Monte Cazazza, pero su significado se define en Sheffield: Throbbing Gristle y Cabaret Voltaire usan el ruido de la fábrica como metáfora de la condición humana a finales del siglo XX. Throbbing Gristle (Second Annual Report, «música de la fábrica de la muerte»; 20 Jazz Funk Greats abre la puerta al industrial bailable y al synth-pop), Cabaret Voltaire, Clock DVA. Con los sellos independientes, la diversificación: Nurse With Wound, Zoviet France, This Heat, 23 Skidoo, Current 93 (y su folk apocalíptico), Hafler Trio, Coil, Psychic TV, Test Dept, Lustmord. Desde Australia, Foetus, el primer compositor «clásico» de la civilización punk (Hole, Nail, Thaw). En EE UU, Arcane Device y Controlled Bleeding.","color":"#94a3b8","family":"Gótico e industrial","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#industrial"},{"id":125507898131948,"name":"Dark ambient","book":"Loops 1 y 2. Una historia de la música electrónica","author":"Javier Blánquez (ed.)","start":1980,"end":1998,"desc":"Ambient + industrial: atmósferas que lejos de relajar se adentran en caminos incómodos e inquietantes.","color":"#38bdf8","family":"Ambient y escucha","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/loops_timeline/#dark-ambient"}],"book_tracks":[{"id":92149460392369,"artist":"Zoviet France","artist_id":250363961032520,"title":"Mohnomishe","year":1983,"ess":0,"yt":"vW5wRHI28uo","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Música industrial","scene_id":145647343892302